# Generated CRD bundles (crds/ in each module, rendered from upstream charts).
# linguist-generated: GitHub collapses them in PR diffs.
# pr-auto-merge=crd-bundle: pr-auto-merge in contiamo/project-ops shows them to
# Claude without their OpenAPI schemas and sends any change that removes a CRD
# to a human (docs/pr-auto-merge.md there).
*/crds/**/*.yaml linguist-generated=true pr-auto-merge=crd-bundle
